# Upstream's file was `* text=auto`, which normalizes line endings on checkout. Inside this
# repository that is destructive: `provenance.json` records a digest per file and this checkout
# carries CRLF bytes, so normalization would leave `LICENSE` and `.gitignore` failing their own
# recorded digests and report a healthy delivered tree as tampered with. The bytes are kept exactly
# as the pinned commit has them, which is what the integrity manifest asserts.
#
# `-text` alone preserves them; diffing stays enabled so the vendored source remains reviewable.
* -text
